===== Product Information ==============================
   Product:             Kith and Kin for Windows Genealogy Database
   Version:             2.03
   Version Date:        22-Jul-1994
   Product Type:        Software
   Basic Distribution Policy (see License, below, for details):
      Shareware, subject to distribution restrictions

   Product Description: A whole new perspective on your family tree. 
                        Excellent shareware program for documenting 
                        and storing family trees. Has an easy to use 
                        graphical interface & powerful editing tools.
                        Pictures, diagrams, sounds, etc may be 
                        embedded in or linked to a person or family. 
                        A printed book can be produced with family 
                        group details and a cross-referenced index. 
                        Also prints descendant and ancestral trees. 
                        286+, Win 3.1, VGA, mouse required.

   Category:            Pedigrees
   Keywords:            GENEALOGY TREE FAMILY KITH KIN WINDOWS OLE
   Required Packages:   kitkin
   This Package:        kitkin

   Required Configuration
      Processor Family: Intel 80x86 (minimum 80286 (AT))
      Minimum OS:       MS-DOS 3.0
      Hard Drive Space: 1000K
      Required:
         Hard drive
         Video Graphics Array (VGA)
         Keyboard
         Mouse
      Won't Work With:
         Floppy only

